{"END": 46.91, "lines": [{"scene": "d01", "voice": "N", "start": 0.35, "end": 4.906, "words": [["Día", 0.35, 0.551], ["uno.", 0.551, 0.93], ["La", 0.93, 1.086], ["señora", 1.086, 1.42], ["de", 1.42, 1.576], ["adelante", 1.576, 2.0], ["en", 2.0, 2.156], ["la", 2.156, 2.312], ["fila", 2.312, 2.557], ["del", 2.557, 2.758], ["supermercado...", 2.758, 3.672], ["muerde", 3.672, 4.006], ["a", 4.006, 4.117], ["la", 4.117, 4.273], ["cajera.", 4.273, 4.786]], "text": "Día uno. La señora de adelante en la fila del supermercado... muerde a la cajera."}, {"scene": "d02", "voice": "N", "start": 5.306, "end": 10.0, "words": [["La", 5.306, 5.477], ["cajera", 5.477, 5.844], ["cae", 5.844, 6.064], ["al", 6.064, 6.236], ["piso.", 6.236, 6.7], ["Diez", 6.7, 6.969], ["segundos", 6.969, 7.434], ["después,", 7.434, 7.972], ["se", 7.972, 8.143], ["levanta.", 8.143, 8.755], ["Y", 8.755, 8.877], ["ya", 8.877, 9.048], ["no", 9.048, 9.219], ["parpadea.", 9.219, 9.88]], "text": "La cajera cae al piso. Diez segundos después, se levanta. Y ya no parpadea."}, {"scene": "d03", "voice": "N", "start": 10.4, "end": 17.103, "words": [["El", 10.4, 10.58], ["vigilante", 10.58, 11.12], ["baja", 11.12, 11.403], ["la", 11.403, 11.583], ["reja", 11.583, 11.866], ["de", 11.866, 12.046], ["golpe.", 12.046, 12.586], ["Adentro", 12.586, 13.023], ["quedan", 13.023, 13.409], ["seis", 13.409, 13.692], ["personas.", 13.692, 14.386], ["Afuera,", 14.386, 14.9], ["en", 14.9, 15.08], ["cinco", 15.08, 15.415], ["minutos,", 15.415, 15.98], ["ya", 15.98, 16.161], ["son", 16.161, 16.392], ["veinte.", 16.392, 16.983]], "text": "El vigilante baja la reja de golpe. Adentro quedan seis personas. Afuera, en cinco minutos, ya son veinte."}, {"scene": "d04", "voice": "N", "start": 17.503, "end": 23.56, "words": [["Tú.", 17.503, 17.846], ["Don", 17.846, 18.051], ["Héctor,", 18.051, 18.508], ["el", 18.508, 18.668], ["carnicero.", 18.668, 19.33], ["Una", 19.33, 19.536], ["mamá", 19.536, 19.787], ["con", 19.787, 19.992], ["su", 19.992, 20.152], ["niña.", 20.152, 20.586], ["Un", 20.586, 20.746], ["repartidor.", 20.746, 21.453], ["Y", 21.453, 21.568], ["una", 21.568, 21.773], ["muchacha", 21.773, 22.207], ["con", 22.207, 22.412], ["el", 22.412, 22.572], ["brazo", 22.572, 22.869], ["vendado.", 22.869, 23.44]], "text": "Tú. Don Héctor, el carnicero. Una mamá con su niña. Un repartidor. Y una muchacha con el brazo vendado."}, {"scene": "d05", "voice": "N", "start": 23.96, "end": 28.467, "words": [["Don", 23.96, 24.16], ["Héctor", 24.16, 24.494], ["apaga", 24.494, 24.784], ["las", 24.784, 24.984], ["luces", 24.984, 25.274], ["y", 25.274, 25.385], ["dice:", 25.385, 25.808], ["los", 25.808, 26.009], ["de", 26.009, 26.165], ["afuera", 26.165, 26.499], ["se", 26.499, 26.655], ["cansan.", 26.655, 27.167], ["Los", 27.167, 27.367], ["de", 27.367, 27.523], ["adentro,", 27.523, 28.013], ["no.", 28.013, 28.347]], "text": "Don Héctor apaga las luces y dice: los de afuera se cansan. Los de adentro, no."}, {"scene": "d06", "voice": "N", "start": 28.967, "end": 35.874, "words": [["A", 28.967, 29.092], ["medianoche,", 29.092, 29.794], ["el", 29.794, 29.969], ["repartidor", 29.969, 30.545], ["te", 30.545, 30.72], ["despierta.", 30.72, 31.447], ["La", 31.447, 31.622], ["venda", 31.622, 31.947], ["de", 31.947, 32.123], ["la", 32.123, 32.298], ["muchacha", 32.298, 32.774], ["tiene", 32.774, 33.099], ["sangre", 33.099, 33.475], ["fresca.", 33.475, 34.051], ["Y", 34.051, 34.176], ["ella", 34.176, 34.452], ["no", 34.452, 34.627], ["deja", 34.627, 34.903], ["de", 34.903, 35.078], ["rascarse.", 35.078, 35.754]], "text": "A medianoche, el repartidor te despierta. La venda de la muchacha tiene sangre fresca. Y ella no deja de rascarse."}, {"scene": "d07", "voice": "N", "start": 36.374, "end": 44.81, "words": [["¿Qué", 36.374, 36.575], ["haces?", 36.575, 37.043], ["Opción", 37.043, 37.377], ["A:", 37.377, 37.667], ["la", 37.667, 37.823], ["encierras", 37.823, 38.291], ["en", 38.291, 38.447], ["el", 38.447, 38.604], ["cuarto", 3